.TH QUIPU-NAMESPACES 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-namespaces \- List or apply the owner namespace registry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu namespaces\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List or apply the owner namespace registry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-namespaces\-list(1)
List the effective owner namespace registry
.TP
quipu\-namespaces\-apply(1)
Apply the configured owner namespace registry to the store
.TP
quipu\-namespaces\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
